---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
Astro.response.status = 404;
const path = Astro.url.pathname;
---
<Base title="页面未找到"><div class="shell page-content empty-state empty-state--404"><p class="eyebrow">404</p><h1>这个页面不在</h1><p>找不到 <code>{path}</code>，可能是链接过期了，或者文章被移走了。</p><div class="notfound-actions"><a href="/">回首页</a><a href="/articles">去看文章</a></div></div></Base>
